Package: dataviz-with-R
Title: Data Visualization Projects with R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Carla Daniela", "Di Monno", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Two reproducible Quarto reports on data visualization with R:
    reservoir volume anomalies in Spain (tidyverse/ggplot2) and relief maps
    of Portugal plus hospital beds in Europe (sf/terra/tidyterra).
